/P 210 0 R
/T (Securing funding is one of the challenges faced by universities and professors in fostering entrepreneurship. Access to financial resources can empower students, faculty, and institutions to develop innovative ideas, launch startups, and expand their entrepreneurial initiatives. However, navigating the landscape of funding opportunities can be overwhelming, leading to missed opportunities and underutilized support mechanisms. )
/E (Securing funding is one of the challenges faced by universities and professors in fostering entrepreneurship. Access to financial resources can empower students, faculty, and institutions to develop innovative ideas, launch startups, and expand their entrepreneurial initiatives. However, navigating the landscape of funding opportunities can be overwhelming, leading to missed opportunities and underutilized support mechanisms. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
