/Title (Common mistakes include weak project objectives, weak alignment with funding priorities, incomplete budgets, and missing documents. To avoid these, carefully read the call guidelines, clearly define measurable goals, ensure financial accuracy, and double-check all required attachments before submission. Involve team members in reviewing the proposal to catch inconsistencies or gaps, and, if possible, seek feedback from previous grant recipients or experts before finalizing the application.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1237 0 R
>>
endobj
